                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Spin(9) \hookrightarrow Spin(9,1)
            of that is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphism
            of the
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jordan+algebra"} Jordan algebra
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure"} structure
            itself, the full
            = succeed "-" do
