                  and the Exceptional Jordan Algebra
                of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Octonions
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/octonions/octonions.html"} web
            %li#Yokota09
              %p
                Ichiro Yokota,
                %em Exceptional Lie groups
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0902.0431"}> arXiv:0902.0431
                )
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_algebra"} Albert algebra
          %h3#ReferencesRelationStandardModel Possible relation to color gauge structure
          %p
